  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Pieces of the past add up to an amazing look for right now with the Nike P-6000, which draws from the Nike Air Pegasus 25 and the Pegasus 2006 for a mash-up of iconic styles that's breathable, comfortable, and evocative of that early-2000s vibe.</p> <ul><li>Breathable mesh has real and synthetic leather overlays to give a 2000s running aesthetic.</li><li>Foam midsole provides lightweight cushioning for a plush underfoot feel.</li><li>No-slip full rubber outsole gives you durable traction.</li><li>Tongue webbing features \"Bowerman Series\" branding.</li><li>Nike logo on tongue tab.</li><li>Molded synthetic leather Swoosh design.</li></ul><hr /><p>When early-2000s running design meets everyday wearability, the result is something worth reaching for every time. The Nike P-6000 pulls design DNA from the Nike Air Pegasus 25 and Pegasus 2006, blending two iconic silhouettes into a mash-up that's breathable, comfortable, and built for the moments between workouts just as much as the workouts themselves.</p> <ul> <li>Breathable mesh upper with real and synthetic leather overlays delivers a classic 2000s running aesthetic.</li> <li>Foam midsole provides lightweight cushioning for a plush, comfortable feel underfoot.</li> <li>Full rubber outsole offers durable, no-slip traction on everyday surfaces.</li> <li>Tongue webbing features \"Bowerman Series\" branding as a nod to Nike's running heritage.</li> <li>Nike logo on the tongue tab and a molded synthetic leather Swoosh round out the retro look.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>The P-6000 fits true to size for most wearers. Reviewers also point to a roomier toe box that works well for those who typically find Nikes a touch narrow — order your standard size with confidence.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Ideal for casual outings, sporting events, and anyone who wants a stylish retro runner that holds its own across everyday life.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>The P-6000's layered mesh and leather upper, chunky midsole profile, and Pegasus-inspired lines make it a versatile piece that pairs naturally with athletic wear, joggers, or relaxed denim. Available across multiple colorways, there's a combination to suit just about any wardrobe.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>The structured sole delivers firm, supportive cushioning that works well for casual walks and daily errands — those logging longer distances may want a few wears to let the shoe fully conform to their stride. Build quality earns strong marks from reviewers, with many noting it holds up well even under daily use.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike P-6000 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Black/Mtlc Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>CD6404-026</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:cen